Package: sanpo
Title: Plots for Epidemiology on Japanese Claims and Medical Databases
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given  = "Yoichi",
           family = "Masui",
           email  = "ichi.r.pro@gmail.com",
           role   = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Static 'ggplot2' figures for epidemiological studies on claims
    and medical databases, with Japanese data in mind: the patient journey
    from treatment-pathway Sankey diagrams (which also draw nodes without
    links) and sunbursts to trends, age pyramids, rates, forest plots and
    survival curves. Each figure is a data function, a plot function and a
    one-call wrapper of the two.
URL: https://github.com/ichirio/sanpo
BugReports: https://github.com/ichirio/sanpo/issues
